  "method": "AH and OU evaluated separately on the exact canonical Crown fixture-market cohort. M3 uses each archived strict UTC OOS score grid and re-selects the higher expected-return side at the newly canonical Crown line/prices. M1 and MR1 V6 use their archived side-specific settlement probability vectors only where their original line exactly equals the canonical Crown line; the opposite-side vector is the exact Asian settlement complement. M4 is the existing Japan J-League/Turkiye Super Lig Pass research rule applied to M3 model selections. One 1U per model/fixture-market, no extra filters or gates. Historical responses were received after kickoff, so ROI is retrospective event-time replay, not executable performance.",
